---
layout: layouts/base.njk
templateClass: flow
permalink: /press/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
noindex: true
title: Press pack — Joe Hart
description: Photos, bios and links for events Joe Hart is speaking at.
emoji: 📸
---

<h1>📸 Press pack</h1>
<p>
  Hello! If I'm speaking at your event, everything here is yours to use for promo: social posts, the website, the
  programme, the big screen. Crop it, resize it, go wild. If a photo has a credit, please include it.
</p>

<h2>Bios</h2>
<div class="press-bios">
  {% for bio in press.bios %}
  <section class="press-bio flow">
    <div class="press-bio-header">
      <h3>{{ bio.label }}</h3>
      <button type="button" class="press-copy" data-copy-target="bio-{{ loop.index }}">Copy</button>
    </div>
    <p id="bio-{{ loop.index }}">{{ bio.text }}</p>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Photos</h2>
<p>Click a photo, or its download link, for the full-resolution original.</p>
<div class="press-photos">
  {% for photo in press.photos %}
  <figure class="press-photo flow">
    <a href="{{ photo.src }}" download="{{ photo.download }}">
      <img src="{{ photo.src }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}" sizes="(min-width: 800px) 400px, 100vw" />
    </a>
    <figcaption>
      {{ photo.caption }}{% if photo.credit %}<br /><span class="press-credit">📷 {{ photo.credit }}</span>{% endif
      %}<br />
      <a href="{{ photo.src }}" download="{{ photo.download }}">Download original</a>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Name &amp; links</h2>
<dl class="press-links">
  <dt>Name</dt>
  <dd>{{ press.name }}{% if press.pronouns %} ({{ press.pronouns }}){% endif %}</dd>
  <dt>Title</dt>
  <dd>{{ press.tagline }}</dd>
  {% for link in press.links %}
  <dt>{{ link.label }}</dt>
  <dd><a href="{{ link.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ link.value }}</a></dd>
  {% endfor %}
</dl>

<h2>Talks</h2>
<p>Previous talks, with recordings where they exist, are on the <a href="/talks/">talks page</a>.</p>

<p>Need something that isn't here? <a href="mailto:joe@joehart.dev">Drop me an email</a>.</p>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.press-copy').forEach((button) => {
    button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const text = document.getElementById(button.dataset.copyTarget).textContent.trim()
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text)
        button.textContent = 'Copied!'
      } catch (e) {
        button.textContent = 'Copy failed'
      }
      setTimeout(() => (button.textContent = 'Copy'), 2000)
    })
  })
</script>
